[
    {
        "id": "tab_bikestation",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "EcoHub Smart Bikestation",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "## EcoHub Smart Bikestation\n\nReal-time MQTT dashboard for a Raspberry Pi-powered smart bike station.\n\n### Existing topics (already wired up)\n- `bikestation/bikeslot-test/status` — station online/offline text\n- `bikestation/system/alerts` — JSON `{type, slot}`\n- `bikestation/slot/1..4/proximity` — JSON `{occupied, distance_cm}`\n- `bikestation/entrance/nfc/tap` — JSON `{timestamp, uid, action}`\n\n### Optional topics (wire up later if you add sensors)\nIf you don't have these sensors yet, the widgets will just stay at 0 — they won't break anything.\n- `bikestation/system/cpu_temp` — Pi CPU temp (°C)\n- `bikestation/system/cpu_load` — Pi CPU load (%)\n- `bikestation/system/memory` — memory usage (%)\n- `bikestation/system/disk` — disk usage (%)\n- `bikestation/system/solar` — solar panel output (W)\n- `bikestation/system/battery_voltage` — battery voltage (V)\n- `bikestation/environment/temp` — ambient temperature (°C)\n- `bikestation/environment/humidity` — humidity (%)\n- `bikestation/environment/air` — air quality index\n- `bikestation/slot/1..4/battery` — per-bike battery level (%)\n\n### Layout\n- **STATION** — header with live clock + status pill\n- **KEY METRICS** — 6 KPI cards (status, available, in use, rides today, maintenance, last alert)\n- **BIKE FLEET** — 4 bike cards (status + distance gauge)\n- **RASPBERRY PI HEALTH** — CPU temp, CPU load, memory, disk, power, voltage\n- **ENVIRONMENTAL SENSORS** — temperature, humidity, AQI, solar\n- **LIVE CHARTS** — distance history + environment trends\n- **ACTIVITY LOG** — NFC tap history table + alert popup"
    },

